       local declarations;
       statements;
       return expression;     /* omitted when return_type is void */
   }

3. Call: function_name(argument1, argument2, ...);  e.g. r = average(7, 8);

Parts: return_type is the type of value sent back (void if none); function_name is any valid identifier; the parameter list holds the formal parameters (void if none); the body is inside { }; return sends a value back and ends the function.

