x(n) = 1² + 2² + ... + (n − 1)² = (n − 1) n (2n − 1) / 6।
Recurrence: f(n) = f(n − 1) + (n − 1)², base case f(1) = 0 (n ≤ 1 হলে বাইরের loop চলে না)।

#include <stdio.h>

/* the given loops: for i = 1..n-1, the j and k loops each run i times */
long loops(int n) {
